# API Configuration
#
# Deliberately empty. Set VITE_API_URL on the Vercel project (it is read at
# BUILD time) or in a local .env.local. With no value the app falls back to
# http://localhost:5000, which fails at the first request instead of quietly
# reaching a backend nobody chose (ENV-03, deployment-environment.md 1.2).
VITE_API_URL=
